@startuml "Chain of Responsibility - Call Center - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A call goes to the first desk that serves the customer: standard, then gold, then VIP
interface CallTaker <<Handler>> {
  + answer(Customer)
}
abstract class AbstractCallTaker {
  - next : CallTaker
  # passOn(Customer)
}
class StandardCallTaker <<ConcreteHandler>>
class GoldCallTaker <<ConcreteHandler>>
class VipCallTaker <<ConcreteHandler>>
note bottom of StandardCallTaker
  Serves standard
  customers.
end note
note bottom of GoldCallTaker
  Serves gold and
  standard customers.
end note
note bottom of VipCallTaker
  Serves VIP, gold and
  standard customers.
end note
interface Customer {
  + askAQuestion()
  + receiveAnswer(String)
}
abstract class AbstractCustomer
class StandardCustomer
class GoldCustomer
class VipCustomer
CallTaker <|.. AbstractCallTaker
AbstractCallTaker <|-- StandardCallTaker
AbstractCallTaker <|-- GoldCallTaker
AbstractCallTaker <|-- VipCallTaker
AbstractCallTaker --> CallTaker : next
Customer <|.. AbstractCustomer
AbstractCustomer <|-- StandardCustomer
AbstractCustomer <|-- GoldCustomer
AbstractCustomer <|-- VipCustomer
@enduml
